      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hoosick%2C_New_York"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Battle of Bennington, a key American Revolution clash, was fought just northeast of Hoosick on John Green’s farm.",
